    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "in-on-at",
        "title": "In, on, at",
        "body": [
          "**Mu** kitera okuba **in**: **in the forest**, **in the lake**. **Ku** kitera okuba **on**: **on the hill**. Ku bifo: **in Jinja** oba **at Jinja**.",
          "**From** kiraga gye kiva: **Fish come from the lake.**"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "lets",
        "title": "“Let’s …”",
        "body": [
          "Mu Luganda **tu-** ku ntandikwa n’**-e** ku nkomerero: **tusimbe**, **tukuume**. Mu Lungereza **Let’s**: **Let’s plant trees! Let’s protect our land.**"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "Ensozi omusanvu",
        "body": [
          "**Kampala was built on seven hills**: Mengo, Kasubi, Kibuli, Namirembe, Lubaga, Nsambya ne Kampala yennyini. Ate e Jinja: **the source of the Nile**."
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "stories": [
